# No NEW environment variables — this feature reuses ap-hub's existing .env
# (GMAIL_CLIENT_ID/SECRET, QBO_SANDBOX_CLIENT_ID/SECRET, SESSION_COOKIE_SECRET, WEB_BASE_URL).
# CHUNK_3 changes two DEFAULTS only (PORT: 3000->3001, GMAIL_REDIRECT_URI/QBO_SANDBOX_REDIRECT_URI
# port to match) — if your .env sets these explicitly, update the port there too.
# See the ap-hub repo root .env.example for the full list.
